 $$
F = \int_{0}^{d} 2eE(1 - y/d) \sqrt{\max(0, 2ry - y^2)}\, dy
$$ 
 $y$ is the variable, the rest are constants with radius $r > 0$. 
 e - strain;
E - stiffness;
d - neutral axis depth;
y - depth;
