 Assuming you are interested in the  Integral Principal Value  $\ds{\pars{~\mathrm{P.V.}~}}$: 

 \begin{align}
\color{#f00}{\mrm{P.V.}\int_{-\infty}^{\infty}{\pars{x + 1}^{2} \over
x\pars{x^{2} + 4}^{2}}\,\dd x} & =
\int_{0}^{\infty}{\pars{x + 1}^{2} - \pars{-x + 1}^{2} \over
x\pars{x^{2} + 4}^{2}}\,\dd x =
4\int_{0}^{\infty}{\dd x \over \pars{x^{2} + 4}^{2}}\,\dd x
\\[5mm] & =
\left.-4\,\partiald{}{\mu}\int_{0}^{\infty}{\dd x \over x^{2} + \mu}
\,\dd x\,\right\vert_{\ \mu\ =\ 4} =
-4\,\partiald{}{\mu}\bracks{\mu^{-1/2}\int_{0}^{\infty}{\dd x \over x^{2} + 1}
\,\dd x}_{\ \mu\ =\ 4}
\\[5mm] & =
-4\,\bracks{-\,\half\,\mu^{-3/2}\,\,\pars{\pi \over 2}}_{\, \mu\ =\ 4} =
